   "heading": {
    "zh": "名字和特征",
    "en": "Name and features",
    "ms": "Nama dan ciri"
   },
   "level": "basic",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "p",
     "text": {
      "zh": "{{t:ephemeroptera}}来自希腊文 ephemeros（只活一天）加 pteron（翅）：成虫的寿命很短。",
      "en": "{{t:ephemeroptera}} comes from the Greek ephemeros (lasting a day) and pteron (wing): adult mayflies live only briefly.",
      "ms": "{{t:ephemeroptera}} berasal daripada bahasa Yunani ephemeros (bertahan sehari) dan pteron (sayap): lalat sehari dewasa hidup sekejap sahaja."
     },
     "defines": [
      "ephemeroptera"
     ],
     "src": [
      "LSJ"
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "note",
     "kind": "key",
     "text": {
      "zh": "「蜉蝣」：成虫一生很短，所以叫「朝生暮死」。",
      "en": "Think 'ephemeral': the adult's life is very short.",
      "ms": "Ingat 'sementara': hayat dewasa sangat singkat."
     },
     "src": [
      "LSJ"
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "list",
     "items": [
      {
       "zh": "身体柔软，翅竖立合在背上",
       "en": "Soft body; wings held upright together over the back",
       "ms": "Badan lembut; sayap ditegakkan bersama di atas belakang"
      },
      {
       "zh": "后翅很小或没有",
       "en": "Hind wings small or absent",
       "ms": "Sayap belakang kecil atau tiada"
      },
      {
       "zh": "尾端通常有 3 条长尾丝，少数 2 条",
       "en": "Usually 3 long tails, a few kinds 2",
       "ms": "Biasanya 3 ekor panjang, sesetengah 2"
      },
      {
       "zh": "稚虫在水中，腹部两侧有叶片状的鳃",
       "en": "Nymphs live in water with leaf-like gills along the abdomen",
       "ms": "Nimfa hidup dalam air dengan insang seperti daun di sepanjang abdomen"
      }
     ],
     "src": [
      "AM-MAYFLY",
      "WTK:7",
      "WTK:9"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
